  "prefLabel": "Spe 308.01 Function of a Provisional License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Spe 308.01 Function of a Provisional License. Pursuant to RSA 326-F:4, a provisional license shall permit an individual to practice speech-language pathology while completing the post-graduate professional experience required for full licensure.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Spe 300) #9125, eff 4-5-08; ss by #10906, eff 8-7-15",
